# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ✅ APPLIED to .env.production on 2026-07-28 (WATI_TPL_WA1..8 + LEAD_ALERT +
#    SHEET_FORM_TAB=Saturday_Workshop are all now set in .env.production directly).
#    This file is kept only as a record — it takes effect on the next prod DEPLOY.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# (Original note) STAGED PROD FLIP → Business Transformation Blueprint (BTB) templates
#
# Why: without these, prod uses the config.ts defaults, which are the OLD
# "High-Performance Teams" templates — correctly dated but wrong positioning,
# mismatching the new BTB landing page.
#
# Status verified live via `node scripts/check-wa-live.mjs .env.production`:
#   WA-1..7 + wa_lead_alert + wa_lead_alert_full = APPROVED
#   wa_8_btb_two_hour_v3 = PENDING  → WA-8 stays on approved generic wa_two_hour
#                                     (old copy) until v3 clears, then flip WA-8 too.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
WATI_TPL_WA1=wa_1_btb_booking_pending
WATI_TPL_WA2=wa_2_btb_value_nudge
WATI_TPL_WA3=wa_3_btb_problem_nudge
WATI_TPL_WA4=wa_4_btb_urgency_nudge
WATI_TPL_WA5=wa_5_btb_confirmation
WATI_TPL_WA6=wa_6_btb_day_before
WATI_TPL_WA7=wa_7_btb_morning_of
WATI_TPL_WA8=wa_two_hour
# Full 7-field ops alert (Name·Phone·Email·Location·Designation·Years·Team size).
# Requires SHEET_FORM_TAB to include Saturday_Workshop so the extra fields are read;
# older form tabs lack years/location and those render as "—".
WATI_TPL_LEAD_ALERT=wa_lead_alert_full

# ── When wa_8_btb_two_hour_v3 is APPROVED, change the WA-8 line above to: ──
# WATI_TPL_WA8=wa_8_btb_two_hour_v3
